Error [E0205]: `SharedGuard.wait` needs an edit guard
  --> tests/ui/shared_guard_read_wait.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |     _ :: guard.wait(changed, value => value == 1)
    |                ^^^^
 Why: waiting releases and reacquires exclusive access before the predicate is checked again
 Fix: create this guard with `guard_edit()`
